---
description: Pick Prophet implementation and research workflow
alwaysApply: true
---

Before changing this repository, read:

- `docs/implementation_plan.md`
- `docs/schema.md`
- `docs/methodology.md`
- `docs/data_sources.md`

Work from the first unchecked, unblocked task in the implementation plan unless
the user assigns another task. Treat P0 weekly-card work as higher priority than
historical research until the current card is finalized.

Never overwrite raw snapshots or finalized cards, invent missing values, expose
credentials, join on team names without an audit trail, or use data published
after kickoff. Add tests with implementation changes and update the plan only
after the documented acceptance checks pass.

Every handoff must identify the task ID, tests run, timing semantics of any new
data, leakage risks, known gaps, output readiness, and next unblocked task.
